\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Jesus Christ, is risen today,
\par Hallelujah!
\par Our triumphant holy day,
\par Hallelujah!
\par Who did once upon the Cross,
\par Hallelujah!
\par Suffer to redeem our loss,
\par Hallelujah!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Hymns of praises let us sing,
\par Hallelujah!
\par Unto Christ our heavenly King,
\par Hallelujah!
\par Who endured the Cross and grave,
\par Hallelujah!
\par Sinners to redeem and save:
\par Hallelujah!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. But the pain which He endured, 
\par Hallelujah!
\par Our salvation hath procured;
\par Hallelujah!
\par Now above the sky He's King,
\par Hallelujah!
\par Where the angles ever sing.
\par Hallelujah!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Sing we to our God above,
\par Hallelujah!
\par Praise eternal as His love,
\par Hallelujah!
\par Praise Him, all ye heavenly host,
\par Hallelujah!
\par Father, Son, and Holy Ghost!
\par Hallelujah!
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

